# 10. Wave 5 Whole-Space Campaign (Fronts A–D: Non-Radial Preimage Weights,
#     T_diamond2 & Multi-Term/Non-Triangular Barriers, 2D Beukers–Rhin & m-Block
#     Resultants, Coupled q-Rays & Pi_2^0 Proof-Complexity Calibration)
